  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING: Base URL changed to https://platform-api2.max.ru (required since Jul 2026)\n\t  BREAKING: added error codes (field \"code\"); responses with success=false now throw MaxApiException instead of being silently ignored\n\t  BREAKING: SendMessageAsync returns MaxMessage (mid/seq of created message no longer lost)\n\t  BREAKING: UploadAsync rewritten to the official two-step flow (POST /uploads?type= + upload to returned URL); old direct multipart /upload no longer supported by MAX\n\t  BREAKING: removed dead types UploadResponse, FileUploadResult usage, MaxCreateSubscriptionRequest; MaxSubscription now has url/time/update_types per spec\n\t  New: full method coverage of MAX Bot API: GET /me, PATCH /me/commands, chats info/edit/actions/pin/members/admins/leave, GET+PUT+DELETE /messages, GET /messages/(id), GET /videos/(token), comments (send/get/edit/delete/get by id), GET /updates (long polling), subscriptions with secret\n\t  New: all update types (message_edited/removed, comment_created/edited/removed, bot_added/removed, user_added/removed, bot_stopped, dialog_*, chat_title_changed, bot_admin_permissions_changed)\n\t  Fix: MaxUpdate.Timestamp was a field, so it was never deserialized - now a property; added all update payload fields (title, is_channel, permissions, post_id, muted_until, etc.)\n\t  New: typed attachment payloads (image/video/audio/file/sticker/contact/share/location) + GetPayload<T>()\n\t  New: html text format, clipboard keyboard button type, CancellationToken support on all methods",
